    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-act22">
        <head xml:id="gom-act22-Hd1e98">Caput 22</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-act22-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-act22-Hd1e102">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act22-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act22-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act22_3@7-8">Natus in Tarso.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act22-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-act22-Nd1e110" ref="#Bede">BED.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act22-Qd1e113"><seg type="qs">Natus in oppido Galilaeae Giscali nomine fuit Paulus</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sic Christus, in Bethleem natus, Nazarenus est appellatus.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act22-d1e121">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act22-Qd1e123" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act22_3@23-24">Aemulator legis.</quote>
            In Graeco: <quote xml:id="gom-act22-Qd1e126" source="http://scta.info/resource/IImac4_2@8-10">Aemulator legis Dei existentis,</quote> secundum illud: <quote xml:id="gom-act22-Qd1e129" source="http://scta.info/resource/rom10_2@1-12">Testimonium illis perhibeo, quod aemulationem Dei habent, sed non secundum scientiam</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act22-Dd1e134">
          <head xml:id="gom-act22-Hd1e136">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act22-d1e138">
            <pb ed="#P" n="0465C"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act22-Qd1e142" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act22_7@9-10">Saule, Saule.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act22-Rd1e145"><name xml:id="gom-act22-Nd1e146" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act22-Qd1e149">Quaedam exemplaria habent: <quote xml:id="gom-act22-Qd1e151" source="http://scta.info/resource/act22_7@9-10">Saul, Saul,</quote> ut ostendatur de nomine Saulis Saulum nominatum esse.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act22-Dd1e157">
          <head xml:id="gom-act22-Hd1e159">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act22-d1e161">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act22-Qd1e163" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act22_9@7-7">Audierunt.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act22-Rd1e166"><name xml:id="gom-act22-Nd1e167" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act22-Qd1e170">Intellexerunt, sed solum sonum vocis Pauli, vel ejus qui Paulo loquebatur.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act22-Dd1e174">
          <head xml:id="gom-act22-Hd1e176">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act22-d1e178">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act22-Qd1e180" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act22_10@14-15">Et ibi.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act22-Rd1e183"><name xml:id="gom-act22-Nd1e184" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act22-Qd1e187">Exemplum humilitatis, contra doctores non disputandi, nec de nobis praesumendi, quasi a Deo simus edocti.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act22-Dd1e192">
          <head xml:id="gom-act22-Hd1e194">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act22-d1e196">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act22-Qd1e198" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act22_13@8-10">Saule frater, respice.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act22-Rd1e201"><name xml:id="gom-act22-Nd1e202" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act22-Qd1e205">Duo erant in oculis Pauli, excaecatio et illuminatio: et ideo merito credidit.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act22-Dd1e209">
          <head xml:id="gom-act22-Hd1e211">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act22-d1e213">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act22-Qd1e215" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act22_14@7-8">Praeordinavit te.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act22-Rd1e218"><name xml:id="gom-act22-Nd1e219" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act22-Qd1e222">Conveniens ordo: primo, praeordinatus in praescientia Dei; deinde cognoscit veritatem, videt Justum, audit ex ore <pb ed="#P" n="0465D"/> ipsius; postea fit testis eorum quae cognovit, vidit, audivit.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act22-Dd1e229">
          <head xml:id="gom-act22-Hd1e231">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act22-d1e233">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act22-Qd1e235" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act22_17@12-16">Fieri me in stupore mentis.</quote>
            Hoc non narrat ad elationem, sed propter necessitatem, ut videatur idoneus evangelizare gentibus.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act22-Dd1e240">
          <head xml:id="gom-act22-Hd1e242">Versus 20</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act22-d1e244">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act22-Qd1e246" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act22_20@11-11">Consentiebam.</quote>
            Confitendo quod consensit, notat quia non occidit, nisi caedens accipiatur pro occidens, vel occidere curans.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act22-Dd1e251">
          <head xml:id="gom-act22-Hd1e253">Versus 28</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act22-d1e255">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act22-Qd1e257" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act22_28@4-6">Ego multa summa.</quote>
            Alia editio manifestius insinuat quid dixerit tribunus. Dixit tribunus: tam facile dicis civem Romanum te esse? ego enim quanto pretio civilitatem possedi istam.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act22-d1e261">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act22-Qd1e263" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act22_28@7-7">Civilitatem.</quote>
            Id est socialem inter cives conversationem, vel reipublicae administrationem. Non enim <pb ed="#P" n="0466A"/> tribunus civitatis Romanae civis esse non posset, sed consortium civitatis emerat, ut esset particeps. Paulus eo magis erat civis Romanus, quod non comparando, sed hoc nascendo habebat.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
